        "**Input**: Markdown documents.",
        "**Intermediate model**: Presentation IR and Layout IR.",
        "**Outputs**: editable PPTX, plus HTML and PDF.",
        "**Runtime**: rule-based parsing, splitting, layout, validation, theme selection, and rendering.",
        "**LLM-advised quality**: use mdpr-skill when you want agent-side semantic hints, review loops, or visual-quality advice before MDP",
        "**Agent boundary**: mdpr-skill may pass compact semantic hints through --hints, but MDPR rejects final layout/style decisions. MDP"
      ],
      "hasTable": true,
      "table": [
        [
          "Decision boundary",
          "MDPR",
